      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.18,
          "end": 4.29,
          "en": "So let's now wrap up this module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.29,
          "end": 9.14,
          "en": "by also exploring the context API with TypeScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.14,
          "end": 11.76,
          "en": "For this, I'll add a new folder, store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.76,
          "end": 12.96,
          "en": "which is not a must have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.96,
          "end": 16.06,
          "en": "but the convention we used typically in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.06,
          "end": 21.06,
          "en": "and there I'll add my todo stash context.tsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.59,
          "end": 24.983,
          "en": "A TSX because I'll write some JSX code in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.94,
          "end": 28.83,
          "en": "Now, in there, we can start by creating the todos context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.83,
          "end": 31.973,
          "en": "by calling react, create context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.09,
          "end": 36.31,
          "en": "And for this, even though it's technically not required,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.31,
          "end": 38.8,
          "en": "it's not a bad idea to import react",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.8,
          "end": 40.28,
          "en": "to make it a bit more transparent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.28,
          "end": 42.513,
          "en": "where react is coming from here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.46,
          "end": 45.95,
          "en": "Now, I'm calling create context here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.95,
          "end": 49.33,
          "en": "and create context actually wants a default value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.33,
          "end": 51.54,
          "en": "it wants one argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.54,
          "end": 55.15,
          "en": "And here it can be an object where we describe the shape",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.15,
          "end": 58.16,
          "en": "of this todos context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.16,
          "end": 61.29,
          "en": "And there we'll have our items, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.29,
          "end": 63.79,
          "en": "which will initially be an empty array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.79,
          "end": 68.78999999999999,
          "en": "And then we also have the add todo function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.07,
          "end": 72.24,
          "en": "which will be a function that does nothing here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.24,
          "end": 74.35,
          "en": "and the remove todo function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.35,
          "end": 78.07300000000001,
          "en": "which gets the idea of type string, and then does nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.76,
          "end": 84.08,
          "en": "Now, at this point already, we can add more TypeScript logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.08,
          "end": 87.59,
          "en": "because for example, items is an empty array here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.59,
          "end": 90.58,
          "en": "and we again would have the problem that it's not clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.58,
          "end": 95.58,
          "en": "which kind of values should eventually end up in this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.72999999999999,
          "end": 99.33,
          "en": "For that reason, create context also is a generic type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.33,
          "end": 101.57,
          "en": "So we can add those angle brackets here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.57,
          "end": 105.16,
          "en": "after create context in front of the parameter list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.16,
          "end": 108.8,
          "en": "to better describe our context object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.8,
          "end": 111.06,
          "en": "Because here between the brackets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.06,
          "end": 113.47999999999999,
          "en": "we're not setting up some type definition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.47999999999999,
          "end": 116.65,
          "en": "This here is some concrete JavaScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.65,
          "end": 120.68,
          "en": "where we create a JavaScript object with some properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.68,
          "end": 123.35,
          "en": "So here we're not setting up some type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.35,
          "end": 126.34,
          "en": "The only type we're setting up here is this argument type,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.34,
          "end": 128.703,
          "en": "because I'm creating a concrete function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.86,
          "end": 133.11,
          "en": "To define the overall type of this object here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.11,
          "end": 136.73,
          "en": "we need to use this generic type feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.73,
          "end": 138.02,
          "en": "between the angle brackets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.02,
          "end": 141.483,
          "en": "and then describe our context object type here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.34,
          "end": 144.09,
          "en": "And here, we can now make it clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.09,
          "end": 147.69,
          "en": "that items will now be a todo array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.69,
          "end": 150.94,
          "en": "For that we import todo from the models folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.94,
          "end": 152.87,
          "en": "and the todo file there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.87,
          "end": 155.43,
          "en": "And now here we have a pure type definition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.43,
          "end": 156.61,
          "en": "So here I'm making it clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.61,
          "end": 159.61,
          "en": "that items will be of type todo array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.61,
          "end": 162.06,
          "en": "And then I'm making it clear that add todo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.06,
          "end": 165.45,
          "en": "will be a function type that returns nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.45,
          "end": 167.47,
          "en": "So that's the difference to down there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.47,
          "end": 169.9,
          "en": "that's a concrete function definition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.9,
          "end": 172.04,
          "en": "with a empty function body.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.04,
          "end": 174.16,
          "en": "That's a function type definition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.16,
          "end": 176.19,
          "en": "where I'm just defining the return type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.19,
          "end": 179.95,
          "en": "of that function here, void, and no parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.95,
          "end": 181.153,
          "en": "And then remove todo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.28,
          "end": 184.38,
          "en": "which is also a function that returns nothing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.38,
          "end": 188.433,
          "en": "but that gets an argument of type string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.52,
          "end": 191.893,
          "en": "And that's now my to do's context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.36,
          "end": 196.7,
